## Source File Fixes (Linux compat)

- src/08_structs.swift: replaced String(format: "#%02X%02X%02X", ...) with stdlib hex helper
    (String.init(format:) requires Foundation; unavailable on Linux without import)

- src/18_opaque_types.swift: added primary associated type syntax to Sequence2 protocol
    Changed: protocol Sequence2 { associatedtype Element }
    To:      protocol Sequence2<Element> { associatedtype Element }
    (required for `some Sequence2<Int>` return type syntax)

- src/19_extensions.swift: replaced components(separatedBy:) with split(separator:).map(String.init)
    (components(separatedBy:) requires Foundation)

- src/21_result_builders.swift: added buildEither + buildArray + buildExpression to ArrayBuilder
    Added buildEither to StringBuidler; changed ArrayBuilder to use [T]... blocks
    (Swift requires these for if/else in result builder contexts)

